  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_01",
      "hash64": "EB33E0E6A24382AC",
      "text": "這裡的書多得我讀不完……\\n來到這間學校真是太好了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_01",
      "hash64": "A478CD916FCE4570",
      "text": "聽對戰學的課，\\n就覺得自己能夠變強！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_07",
      "hash64": "A478D3916FCE4FA2",
      "text": "泰姆老師的數學課，\\n無意中也能學到對戰的知識呢～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_09",
      "hash64": "EB33E8E6A2439044",
      "text": "雖然和寶可夢沒什麼關係，\\n但語言學也很有趣喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
