    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_03",
      "hash64": "EB33E2E6A2438612",
      "text": "雖然我很擅長寶可夢對戰，\\n但我不太會讀書～\\r\\n……教教我怎麼準備考試吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_04",
      "hash64": "EB33DDE6A2437D93",
      "text": "雖然我很會讀書，\\n但寶可夢對戰還得加把勁！\\r\\n……教教我怎麼打寶可夢對戰吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
