    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_10",
      "hash64": "EB305BE6A2406AD6",
      "text": "理組課程有個叫做牡丹的女生，\\n她很聰明也很擅長機械的領域。\\r\\n聽說她最近回來學校上課了喔。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_08",
      "hash64": "A478D6916FCE54BB",
      "text": "發出聲音把課本的內容念出來，\\n就能用眼耳口來記住內容！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_09",
      "hash64": "A478D5916FCE5308",
      "text": "我想學習跟寶可夢有關的事，\\n所以來這間學校就讀。\\r\\n但我對理組課程也開始有興趣了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_11",
      "hash64": "EB305CE6A2406C89",
      "text": "蟲屬性寶可夢會吃草……\\n所以蟲屬性能剋制草屬性寶可夢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_12",
      "hash64": "EB3059E6A2406770",
      "text": "在我問了好幾次問題以後，\\n我就被老師給記住了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_03",
      "hash64": "A75C187C419B1996",
      "text": "好傷藥和厲害傷藥的回復量……\\n比較多的是哪一個？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_04",
      "hash64": "A75C1B7C419B1EAF",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳知道天星隊嗎？\\n滿久之前他們曾經鬧過事。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_poke_24",
      "hash64": "01B48409590A47B4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 76]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "004C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_man_03",
      "hash64": "4A9BB8FB162BB5D4",
      "text": "我不是老師，是個學生。\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳看！我穿著制服，對吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_man_06",
      "hash64": "4A9BB5FB162BB0BB",
      "text": "鋼屬性招式對妖精屬性寶可夢效果絕佳……\\n正確嗎！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_man_07",
      "hash64": "4A9BB4FB162BAF08",
      "text": "屬性有２種的寶可夢，\\n要掌握牠們的相剋關係好難啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_02",
      "hash64": "A75C197C419B1B49",
      "text": "因為晚上也能聽講，\\n所以我能夠白天工作，晚上上課。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_05",
      "hash64": "A75C1A7C419B1CFC",
      "text": "一睡就會睡上一整天～\\n覺得那樣太可惜就熬夜……\\r\\n但隔天早上又會很後悔呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_06",
      "hash64": "A75C1D7C419B2215",
      "text": "我撿到了寶可夢掉的硬幣。\\c\\n我保管好硬幣想還給牠，\\n但那隻寶可夢很小隻，我找都找不到牠。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
